- **Aggregation:** Median; disagreement reported as IQR.
- **Consistency check:** CPT rows must sum to 1; if a row's elicited distribution violates coherence, re-elicit.
- **Backtesting:** Posteriors are backtested against historical analogs (maritime containerization, CDN buildout) to assess calibration before application to space.

