## Appendix F — Model-Comparison Design and Pre-Registration

### F.1 Models Compared

| Model | Specification | Free parameters |
|---|---|---:|
| Threshold | \( S(t) = \sum_j w_j \mathbf{1}\{X_j > \tau_j\} \) | \( \tau_j, w_j \) |
